---
import Article from '../layouts/Article.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Article
  title={`Contact — ${SITE.name}`}
  heading="Contact"
  kicker="Enquiries in confidence"
  description={`Reach ${SITE.name}. Based on Salt Spring Island, British Columbia; engagements across Canada and the United States, delivered remote-first.`}
>
  <p>
    The fastest route is the <a href="/project-review">project review request</a> — it asks the questions we
    would ask anyway. For anything else, or if you would simply rather write, use the details below. Every
    enquiry is read by a principal, held in confidence, and answered within two business days. We are glad to
    execute your form of NDA before a first conversation.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose mt-10 max-w-xl">
    <dl>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] border-t border-rule py-4">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">Email</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-mono text-sm text-accent underline underline-offset-4">
            {SITE.email}
          </a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] border-t border-rule py-4">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">Home base</dt>
        <dd class="text-sm">{SITE.homeBase}</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-[8rem_1fr] border-y border-rule py-4">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold">Service area</dt>
        <dd class="text-sm">{SITE.serviceArea}</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <h2>Who we hear from</h2>
  <p>
    Owners, naturally — but just as often the people around them: family offices weighing a project’s
    governance, lawyers whose client has a construction agreement on their desk, architects who want their
    design protected by a well-run project. If you advise someone who is about to sign, the
    <a href="/services/pre-construction-audit">Pre-Construction Audit</a> is the engagement to point them to.
  </p>
</Article>
